<includeonly>{{#invoke:Vars|get}}</includeonly><noinclude>
Shows a live value from the mod. The number updates by itself whenever the mod changes, so pages never go out of date.

* <code><nowiki>{{V|food.slots}}</nowiki></code> shows the value with its unit.
* <code><nowiki>{{V|food.keg.duration|unit=no}}</nowiki></code> leaves the unit off.
* <code><nowiki>{{V|food.keg.duration|raw=1}}</nowiki></code> gives the exact number from the code.
* <code><nowiki>{{V|item.ashenblade.damage}}</nowiki></code> and <code><nowiki>{{V|spell.firebolt.mana}}</nowiki></code> show item and spell stats.

Every name you can use is on [[Project:Variables]]. Capitals do not matter. A mistyped name shows a red message with the closest match.

